OR \"integrated system model\" OR \"integrated system models\" OR \"integrated systems model\" OR \"integrated systems models\" OR \"system-level model\" OR \"system-level models\" OR \"system level model\" OR \"system level models\" OR \"digital thread\" OR \"digital threads\" OR \"digital twin\" OR \"digital twins\")",
